        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your son Courtney is a streamer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unbeknownst to him, you're the most active moderator in his chat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People are always popping in and leaving rude messages. As his doting father, your role is to protect him from their vitriol.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811040/extras/68db42153f26c62afbc7e9fa016e0b44.avif?t=1765475117\" width=616 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules of this game are simple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See a rude message in chat? Delete it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Someone asked something creepy? EZ ban.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chat is theorizing about his personal life? Blow them all up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you fail, Courtney might read their messages...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We wouldn't want that, would we?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811040/extras/e0718da8653f3c990e078b8320a4e01d.avif?t=1765475117\" width=616 height=150 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique hand-drawn art and animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Renamable protagonist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About 3 hours of gameplay</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your son Courtney is a streamer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unbeknownst to him, you're the most active moderator in his chat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People are always popping in and leaving rude messages. As his doting father, your role is to protect him from their vitriol.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811040/extras/68db42153f26c62afbc7e9fa016e0b44.avif?t=1765475117\" width=616 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules of this game are simple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See a rude message in chat? Delete it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Someone asked something creepy? EZ ban.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chat is theorizing about his personal life? Blow them all up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you fail, Courtney might read their messages...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We wouldn't want that, would we?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811040/extras/e0718da8653f3c990e078b8320a4e01d.avif?t=1765475117\" width=616 height=150 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique hand-drawn art and animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Renamable protagonist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About 3 hours of gameplay</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "A visual novel where you play as a moderator in your son's stream and help protect him from bullies in chat.",
